{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fantastical world reminiscent of Gion, with its rows of Japanese-style streets, in this exploration horror game reminiscent of the \u201cExit 8\u201d series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players uncover lurking \u201canomalies\u201d while drawing closer to the truth hidden behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discern all the abnormalities lurking within this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one\u2014me\u2014must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997180?t=1757271438","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/5d23714fb428442800b9862aa300e42ce92d94b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757271438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/d2f126a83a296cb0a0bb430f40804c86086d6eb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757271438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/d2f126a83a296cb0a0bb430f40804c86086d6eb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757271438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fantastical world reminiscent of Gion, with its rows of Japanese-style streets, in this exploration horror game reminiscent of the \u201cExit 8\u201d series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players uncover lurking \u201canomalies\u201d while drawing closer to the truth hidden behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discern all the abnormalities lurking within this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days that should remain unchanged. Then why am I here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fox causing the anomalies, and the supernatural beings who abhor change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in this world with no allies, the chosen one\u2014me\u2014must pursue the mystery through prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress centers on discovering anomalies and praying with offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirming discovered anomalies advances the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making offerings unlocks new anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 30+ types of anomalies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We especially hope those who feel a certain dullness in their daily lives will play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Videos &amp; Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are highly encouraged! We'd be thrilled if you shared your impressions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Request from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent production by an amateur high school student. There may be areas of inexperience or bugs, but we'd be grateful if you could enjoy it with a kind eye.</p>","developers":["Burg Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/594440ac2e5a8d0946604521c6f3bc98abc951d9/header.jpg?t=1757271438","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u7947\u5712\u56de\u5eca-GionKairou-","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["burg"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"10 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/08919bd45559cb9a82893763b26d03559aa9f2e5/ss_08919bd45559cb9a82893763b26d03559aa9f2e5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757271438","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/08919bd45559cb9a82893763b26d03559aa9f2e5/ss_08919bd45559cb9a82893763b26d03559aa9f2e5.600x338.jpg?t=1757271438"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/71d76aa7ea461fa1d00e0771e1dcdca87d8f2105/ss_71d76aa7ea461fa1d00e0771e1dcdca87d8f2105.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757271438","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/71d76aa7ea461fa1d00e0771e1dcdca87d8f2105/ss_71d76aa7ea461fa1d00e0771e1dcdca87d8f2105.600x338.jpg?t=1757271438"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997180/2bcd593074927c0eccc3ca0262e12e5e7d021322/ss_2bcd593074927c0eccc3ca0262e12e5e7d021322.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757271438","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass